&lt;p&gt;Multiply the two levers together and you get the price per build. That Docker image costs &lt;strong&gt;$0.175&lt;/strong&gt; on GitHub (14m36s at $0.012) and &lt;strong&gt;$0.045&lt;/strong&gt; on Sengi (7m34s at $0.006): &lt;strong&gt;74% less per build.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

