&lt;h2&gt;


  What I Built
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;🦥 &lt;strong&gt;SlothSort — A Sloth-Themed File Organizer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SlothSort is a web application designed to make file organization simpler and less tedious. The goal is to help users spend less time manually organizing files and explore how AI could make the process easier.&lt;/p&gt;

